; Which words are spelled out. First card in: 1 if the text has a small letter. Then cards pass through; for a
; word's letters (1-27) it counts l (letters, apostrophes not counted) and notes a vowel A E I O U (hv) and the last
; letter. At the word's end (-10) comes lw (0 all capitals, 1 a small letter, 2 all capitals, counted as in an
; all-capitals text); out goes -11 if the word is to be spelled: all capitals, and one letter other than A and I, or
; two or more with no vowel or not in an all-capitals text; else -10.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            start   INP   lowt     03-15: the flag; a card: pass it on, a letter, or the word's end
  04            rec     INP   x
  05                    CLA   x
  06                    TAC   neg
  07                    SUB   c28
  08                    TAC   let
  09            pass    OUT   x
  10                    JMP   rec
  11            neg     ADD   c10
  12                    TAC   pass
  13                    SUB   00
  14                    TAC   endw
  15                    JMP   pass
  16            let     ADD   c28      16-31: a letter, counted
  17                    OUT   x
  18                    SUB   c27
  19                    TAC   lt
  20                    JMP   rec
  21            lt      CLA   l
  22                    ADD   00
  23                    STO   l
  24                    CLA   x
  25                    STO   last
  26                    SUB   n6
  27                    TAC   hvs
  28                    JMP   rec
  29            hvs     CLA   00
  30                    STO   hv
  31                    JMP   rec
  32            endw    INP   lw       32-64: spelled or not
  33                    CLA   z
  34                    STO   sp
  35                    CLA   lw
  36                    SUB   00
  37                    TAC   up
  38                    SUB   00
  39                    TAC   e10
  40            up      CLA   l
  41                    SUB   00
  42                    TAC   e10
  43                    SUB   00
  44                    TAC   one
  45                    CLA   lw
  46                    SUB   n2
  47                    TAC   c0
  48                    JMP   capy
  49            c0      CLA   lowt
  50                    SUB   00
  51                    TAC   capy
  52                    JMP   spel
  53            capy    CLA   hv
  54                    SUB   00
  55                    TAC   spel
  56                    JMP   e10
  57            one     CLA   last
  58                    SUB   n2
  59                    TAC   e10
  60                    CLA   last
  61                    SUB   n5
  62                    TAC   spel
  63                    SUB   00
  64                    TAC   e10
  65            spel    OUT   m11      65-87: the end card, and all cleared
  66                    JMP   rst
  67            e10     OUT   m10
  68            rst     CLA   z
  69                    STO   l
  70                    STO   hv
  71                    JMP   rec
  72            lowt    DATA  0
  73            x       DATA  0
  74            l       DATA  0
  75            hv      DATA  0
  76            last    DATA  0
  77            lw      DATA  0
  78            sp      DATA  0
  79            z       DATA  0
  80            n2      DATA  2
  81            n5      DATA  5
  82            n6      DATA  6
  83            c27     DATA  27
  84            c28     DATA  28
  85            c10     DATA  10
  86            m10     DATA  -10
  87            m11     DATA  -11
